  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- IEventStore.ReadLastAsync — returns the single highest-position matching event in O(1) file reads; 192x faster than full ReadAsync at 10K events.\n- N-ary BuildDecisionModelAsync overload — accepts IReadOnlyList<IDecisionProjection<TState>> for runtime-variable homogeneous projections.\n- TimeProvider constructor overload on DecisionProjection<TState> — fully deterministic unit testing of time-dependent projections.\n- Sample: Opt-In Token pattern (ExamRegistration/) — server-generated single-use exam registration tokens.\n- Sample: Dynamic Product Price, all three features (CourseBookPurchase/) — including N-ary shopping-cart overload.\n- Sample: Prevent Record Duplication (CourseAnnouncement/) — client-generated idempotency token.\n- Sample: Invoice Number / Consecutive Sequence (InvoiceCreation/) — gap-free invoice numbering with ReadLastAsync.\n- Sample: Event-Sourced Aggregate (CourseAggregate/) — DCB tag-scoped AppendCondition in repository.\n- Sample: CourseBuyersProjection — read model tracking every student who purchased each course book.\n- Sample: Paging — PaginatedResponse<T> from list endpoints; SortOrder enum for ascending/descending control.\n- Data Seeder (Opossum.Samples.DataSeeder) — standalone CLI tool that seeds the CourseManagement sample.\n\nFixed:\n- Zero-allocation hot path restored in incremental projection updates — 55-65% speedup; 0 B allocated per incremental update (was 11-16 KB).\n- Large no-flush batch regression resolved — batch-50: -13%, batch-100: -12% vs preview.1.\n- Projection rebuild admin endpoint — now correctly targets only the named projections supplied.\n- Test flakiness in concurrent-append integration tests.\n\nPerformance (2026-03-03):\n- Incremental projection update: 3.68 us / 0 B (zero-allocation hot path verified).\n- ReadLastAsync: 799 us (100 events) to 1,105 us (10,000 events) — near-O(1) confirmed.\n- High-selectivity tag query: 553 us to ~501 us (-9%).\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/majormartintibor/Opossum/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
